5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I think we should be really careful about the budget this time! I'll look into the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I would like to see what the seniors say about year-groups mixing, and perhaps the attendance sheets for the away camps.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I will check the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, as well as the lottery and application for public group bookings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know about the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll look into the membership list against first-train times and the vacation timetable for the club's own hall.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,Does anyone else think we should check the cooking duty? I'm worried about how the work is split up.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a thoughtful point, Mio, but I believe Ryuji has already volunteered to look into the cooking duty for us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Correct. I have it covered. I'll make sure to see exactly how much time the duty took from the participants.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm just so excited to see where we can go! I hope the inland places are actually fun and not too strict.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,We should focus on the facts first. I'll stick with the hall timetable and the train times to see if staying local is even feasible.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I guess you're right, Misaki. I'll just stick to my plan and see how the transport costs and building lets look.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall remain with my choices as well. Understanding why some members don't attend and how we can bond is very important to me.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will proceed with the lottery process and the cooking duty. It is better to know the administrative burden before we commit to a public facility.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'll stick with the inland club accounts and the rate sheet! I want to know if the beds are comfy and how much they cost.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll keep my selections. Knowing the hall's availability and the members' commute times will give us a clear baseline for our options.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Alright, I'm set! Let's get these details sorted so we can pick the best spot for everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am looking forward to seeing what we discover. Let us all do our best to find the most harmonious solution for the club.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am ready. I will begin my research into the administrative requirements and the cooking duties immediately.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to find out everything about those inland beds and the rates right now!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm ready as well. I will check the hall schedule and the train times and report back.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
