35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, transport is way more expensive than I thought when we go far! Also, those whole-building lets seem really risky if people cancel.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems that the evenings are where the real bonding happens, though it is worrying to see how many members have left the club after away camps.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The administrative burden for public bookings is surprisingly high, and the cooking duty last year was a significant drain on the organizers' time.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,The inland places sound a bit scary! Eight people to a room and lights out at eleven? But the beds are actually really cheap!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The club hall is already quite crowded with other groups, and a third of our members can't even make it by nine without staying overnight.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"If we stay on campus, we'd still have to pay for beds for some people, and that might end up being just as expensive as going somewhere else.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very good point, Mio. We must consider whether the convenience of staying local outweighs the social benefits of a shared getaway.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"If we choose a public facility, the lottery system and the paperwork are a nightmare. We cannot afford to waste that much time on administration.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"But if we go to a lodge, will we have to cook? I don't want to spend my whole camp in a kitchen!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"That depends on the lodge's terms, but Ryuji mentioned that cooking for ourselves last year was a huge time sink. We need a place that doesn't burden the organizers.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm worried that if we go to a lodge, the non-refundable deposits will make it unfair for everyone if someone drops out at the last minute.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Perhaps we should prioritize a place where everyone feels welcome and can truly connect, regardless of the financial risk.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree that bonding is important, but we must avoid a situation where the organizers are too exhausted to actually participate in the training.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I don't like the sound of those strict inland dorms! If we have to sleep eight to a room and go to bed so early, we won't have any fun!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we stay on campus, the split schedule and the need for overnight beds for some members make it a logistical mess. We need a more streamlined option.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"So, it sounds like staying on campus is a headache and the public centers are too strict and tedious. Maybe a lodge is the way to go?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"A lodge could be lovely, provided we can ensure it brings the different year-groups together and encourages everyone to attend.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I am still concerned about the workload. If a lodge provides meals, it would solve the cooking issue, but we must be certain about the terms.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I just want somewhere where we can actually sleep and have fun without a strict curfew! A lodge sounds way better than those dorms!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'm still concerned about the budget. If we go with a lodge, we need to be absolutely sure about the total cost and how we handle the payments.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
