60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Now that we know the options, I'm leaning towards the Coastal Lodge! It avoids the transport costs of the inland center and the mess of the campus hall.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The Coastal Lodge seems wonderful for bonding, as having our own building would encourage the year-groups to spend their evenings together and truly connect.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I prefer the Coastal Lodge as well. Having meals arranged by the owner removes the cooking burden from the organizers, which is a priority for me.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm voting for the Coastal Lodge too! It sounds way more relaxing than those scary inland dorms, and I bet the beach is awesome!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'm still worried about the non-refundable deposits and the budget gap, but the other options are too impractical. I'll vote for the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,It seems we are all in agreement then! I'm glad we could find an option that satisfies everyone's concerns.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,It is a relief to see such harmony among us. I truly believe this choice will help our members grow closer and feel more connected.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. As long as the meal arrangements are handled by the owner, the organizers can actually focus on the training as intended.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,I can't wait to go to the beach! It's going to be the best training camp ever since we won't have a strict curfew!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I will make sure we calculate the costs very carefully this time so we don't end up with another deficit in the club accounts.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I'll help you with the calculations, Misaki! Let's make sure we have a clear plan for the payments so it's fair for everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"That is very kind of you, Mio. Let us ensure that every member feels included and that no one is burdened by the arrangements.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will assist with the final logistics to ensure the administrative side is handled efficiently and doesn't fall on just one or two people.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'll help too! I can make a list of all the fun things we can do at the beach so everyone wants to come!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I appreciate the offers. Let's just make sure we have a firm commitment from everyone before we pay that deposit.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I'll make sure to double-check the headcount! I vote for the Coastal Lodge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I believe this is the best choice for our club's spirit. I vote for the Coastal Lodge.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with the consensus. I vote for the Coastal Lodge.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! I vote for the Coastal Lodge!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"For the sake of the club's harmony and efficiency, I vote for the Coastal Lodge.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
